#====================================================================
# Draft: CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 放进 conan toolchain 文件无效——CMake 只在首个 project() 才读 toolchain
# 来源: tdlib/1.8.0 适配（CMake 4.1.2），对照实验 19/20-*.log
# 复用面: 所有在 CMake 4.x 上编译「cmake_minimum_required(<3.5) 老工程」的 conan 配方
# 关系: E187/E103 给出「用 -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5」的正解；本条补齐
#       「放哪里才生效」的位置陷阱（conan 配方最自然的写法恰好是无效写法）
#====================================================================

draft:                 true
id:                    DRAFT-tdlib-1.8.0-cmake-policy-minimum-toolchain-too-late
status:                pending-editor-review
trigger_tool:          cmake|configure
phase:                 configuration
error_signature:       Compatibility with CMake < 3\.5 has been removed from CMake|cmake_minimum_required.*VERSION.*3\.[0-4].*FATAL_ERROR|Update the VERSION argument <min> value

severity:              2
category:              cmake, conan, toolchain, configure, build-system
prescan_pattern:       cmake_minimum_required\(\s*VERSION\s+[0-3]\.[0-4]
prescan_globs:         CMakeLists.txt, *.cmake
match_keywords:        CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM, Compatibility with CMake < 3.5, cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.0.2), toolchain 太晚, CMAKE_USER_MAKE_RULES_OVERRIDE 时机, configure cli_args, toolchain 读取时机
title:                 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 写进 conan_toolchain.cmake 不生效：CMake 直到首个 project() 才读 toolchain，而 cmake_minimum_required 在其之前求值

root_cause:            工具链文件（CMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE，conan 的 conan_toolchain.cmake）由 CMake 在**首个 project()/enable_language() 时**才 include，而几乎全部老工程的 CMakeLists.txt 第 1 行就是 cmake_minimum_required(...)；该命令先于 toolchain 求值，因此 toolchain 里用 tc.variables / tc.cache_variables 设的 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM（以及任何只被 cmake_minimum_required 读取的变量）都来不及生效——报错依旧。反过来，-D 命令行缓存变量在 CMakeLists 解析前就已就位，故有效。
affected_scope:        CMake 4.x 上的一切 cmake_minimum_required(<3.5) 老工程；尤其「以为用了 conan 惯用写法 tc.cache_variables[...] 就万事大吉」的配方
error_excerpt:         CMake Error at CMakeLists.txt:1 (cmake_minimum_required): Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed from CMake.（即便 conan_toolchain.cmake 里已写 set(CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM 3.5 CACHE STRING "")）
verification_cmd:      # 对照实验：把该变量只写进 toolchain，header 里加 message() 观察顺序
                       { echo 'message(STATUS "TOOLCHAIN-READ-MARKER")'; cat conan_toolchain.cmake; } > tc2.cmake
                       cmake -S src -B b2 -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=tc2.cmake   # 报错行在 CMakeLists.txt:1，且 MARKER 未打印 → toolchain 尚未被读取
rec_priority:          1
rec_approach:          policy-minimum-via-configure-cli-or-env
rec_description:        把 -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 交给 CMake 命令行（conan 的 CMake.configure(cli_args=[...])），或用环境变量 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5（conan Environment 生成，实测同样生效）。两者都在 CMakeLists 解析前就位。
rec_command:           cmake = CMake(self); cmake.configure(cli_args=["-DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5"])
rec_auto_fix:          false
rec_impl:              cmake-helper-cli-args
fallback_priority:     2
fallback_approach:     env-var-in-generate
fallback_description:  generate() 里用 conan Environment 导出 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM（实测 exit=0 生效），适合 CMake helper 被自定义 build() 绕开的配方
fallback_command:      env = Environment(); env.define("CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM", "3.5"); env.vars(self, scope="build").save_script("policy_floor")
fallback_auto_fix:     false
forbid_1_pattern:      cache_variables\["CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM"\]|variables\["CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM"\]
forbid_1_reason:       该变量必须在 cmake_minimum_required 求值前就位；toolchain 文件被读取的时机晚于 CMakeLists.txt:1，写进 toolchain（无论 variables 还是 cache_variables）均实测无效
forbid_1_consequence:  表现为「明明按惯例加了参数却依旧报同样的 CMake Error」，浪费整轮排查

principles:            P003
causes:                []
caused_by:             []
similar_to:            [E187, E103]
conflicts_with:        []
prerequisite_of:       []
doc_file:              knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-tdlib-1.8.0-cmake-policy-minimum-toolchain-too-late.md
last_updated:          2026-09-24
source_event:          tdlib 1.8.0 适配：toolchain 写法失败（日志 19/20）→ configure cli_args 成功（日志 07/08）
